  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
      "description": "Compare k6 scenario VUs (constant senders vs ramping receivers) with backend CPU. Adjust the **job** variable if your Spring scrape uses another job name.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "### Load vs CPU (thesis narrative)\n\n- **First graph (dual Y-axis):** **Orange** = HTTP **req/s** (left scale). **Yellow** = WebSocket **messages received/s** (right scale). Different scales so the HTTP line is not flattened when WS traffic is much larger.\n- **CPU panel:** JVM **process** CPU (`process_cpu_usage`).\n\n**Why not “VUs per scenario”?** k6’s `k6_vus` has no `scenario` label in Prometheus ([k6#3957](https://github.com/grafana/k6/issues/3957)), so use **HTTP + WS rates** instead.\n\n**Expected:** HTTP sender rate ~flat while WS recv/s rises with more listeners → **CPU rises** → horizontal scaling for listener-heavy load.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
      "description": "Uses `k6_http_reqs_total` and `k6_ws_msgs_received_total` — both include `scenario`. Requires WebSocket traffic via **k6/ws** or **k6/websockets** for WS line. If WS line is empty, see debug panel or use `k6_data_received_total` in Prometheus.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "HTTP senders (req/s)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } },
              { "id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "left" },
              { "id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "HTTP requests/sec" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "WS receivers (msg recv/s)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "yellow", "mode": "fixed" } },
              { "id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right" },
              { "id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "WS messages recv/sec" },
              { "id": "unit", "value": "reqps" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{scenario=\"http_senders\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP senders (req/s)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(k6_ws_msgs_received_total{scenario=\"ws_receivers\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "WS receivers (msg recv/s)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "k6 load by scenario — dual Y-axis (HTTP left, WS right)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
      "description": "Spring Boot / Micrometer: JVM process CPU (one core = up to 100% of that core; on multi-core hosts values can be normalized differently — compare trends).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.7 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.9 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "process_cpu_usage{job=~\"$job\"}",
          "legendFormat": "process CPU ({{instance}})",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Backend: JVM process CPU usage",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
      "description": "Confirms per-scenario series for HTTP and WS message rates (`scenario` label present). `k6_vus` does not split this way — use Explore with `sum(k6_vus)` for the single combined VU gauge.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(k6_http_reqs_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "http_reqs {{scenario}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "Prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(k6_ws_msgs_received_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "ws_msgs_recv {{scenario}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Debug: HTTP + WS msg rates by scenario",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
